{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f7b11c4-2e55-4d0a-b3e8-78a0d9e1124f",
    "name": "Incentive ERP - Party Payment Approval Workflow",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman test collection for the Multi-Level Multi-User Approval System in Incentive ERP.\n\nDemonstrates:\n1. Authentication of personas (Submitter, Level 1 Approvers, Level 2 Approver, Level 3 Approver)\n2. Draft Payment creation (Non-posting)\n3. Voucher submission\n4. Negative test: Maker-checker restriction (submitter cannot approve)\n5. Negative test: Out-of-order early approval by Level 2\n6. Level 1 single approver approval ('ANY ONE' rule)\n7. Negative test: Level 1 duplicate approval attempt by alternate approver\n8. Level 2 approval\n9. Level 3 approval\n10. Final payment disbursement & financial ledger posting\n11. Rejection & resubmission flow",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
